---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
import { ageStages } from '../lib/age-stage';
---
<Layout title="Shop by age — Shishu care">
  <section class="prose">
    <h1>Little stages. Thoughtful choices.</h1>
    <p>Browse products whose verified age range covers your selected stage. Age is a starting point, not a guarantee of fit or suitability; always check measurements and the manufacturer's instructions.</p>
    <div class="age-stage-links">
      {ageStages.map((stage) => <a class="button" href={`/?age=${stage.id}#collection`}>{stage.label} →</a>)}
    </div>
    <h2>Premature or low-birth-weight babies</h2>
    <p>We do not infer specialist suitability from size or age. Ask your baby's healthcare professional about individual needs, and confirm product-specific suitability with the manufacturer. Our current preview catalogue has no verified specialist recommendations.</p>
    <p>The current demo catalogue has not yet been age-verified. Filtered collections may be empty until verified product information is supplied.</p>
  </section>
</Layout>
<style>.age-stage-links{display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:16px;margin:30px 0}</style>
